<title>USA: Fibreboard sees Q4 oper share in line.</title>
<headline>Fibreboard sees Q4 oper share in line.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fibreboard Corp said on Wednesday that it remained comfortable with previously published analysts' estimates for continuing operations of $0.50 to $0.55 per share for the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>Earlier, Fibreboard said it expected fourth quarter net earnings would be below expectations and it would &quot;miss&quot; earnings generated by its resort group, which it sold.</p>
<p>Fibreboard also said it was comfortable with the range of analysts' estimates for 1997 continuing operations.</p>
</text>
